msgstr "設定のバックアップはサポートされていません。"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:698
msgid ""
"Configuration error detected. The upgrade service could not be started due "
"to a missing or invalid system setting. Please check your device "
"configuration or perform a factory reset before re-trying."
msgstr ""
"構成エラーが検出されました。欠落または無効なシステム設定のため、アップグレー"
"ドサービスを開始できませんでした。デバイスの設定を確認するか、再試行前に工場"
"出荷時の設定にリセットしてください。"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:512
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "続行"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:189
msgid "Details"
msgstr "詳細"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:919
