msgstr "ディスク容量の確認に失敗しました: イメージが大きすぎます。"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:450
msgid "Disk space check succeeded."
msgstr "ディスク容量の確認に成功しました。"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:517
msgid "Do you still want to flash this image?"
msgstr "それでもこのイメージを書き込みますか？"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:170
msgid "Download completed successfully!"
msgstr "ダウンロードが正常に完了しました"

#: luci/luci-app-morseupgrade/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/morse/upgrade.js:168
